I have been reading, with interest, this news group for a couple of months.

Today I found out how to post a message so I thought I would drop in a 
couple of cents worth.

The shopping mall concept sounds really fun.  It might be keyed after the
bazaar on Perv (from Lynn Asprins Myth Adventure series).  This place has
shops (usually in tents some of which contain doors to other dimensions
or maybe levels (hmmmm directly to hell?))  There eating establishments
as well as other services available.  I would have to go pull the book off
the shelf to see.  

How about a casino, or gambling tent?  They exist in the bazaar on perv.  
Other services you might find are a priest tent where you might be able
to have a priest or mage of some sort cast remove curse spells on your 
items.  Instead of actually buying a scroll (you may not know what the
remove curse scroll looks like) you could buy the service.  

As you can see, with a little imagination, the options are almost limitless.

